{"id":"concurrente.canales.canal-suma","lesson":"concurrente.canales","kind":"predecir","level":"semilla","required":true,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"La suma que llega por partes"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Sin ejecutarlo, escribe exactamente lo que muestra este programa."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[],"variant":[],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"El productor envía 4, 5 y 6 y cierra. El consumidor suma cada mensaje y, cuando "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Receive","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" da "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["None","literalBoolean"]]},{"type":"text","text":", sale del bucle y escribe 15."}]}],"program":{"id":"prediccion","title":"","source":"Subroutine Suspendable Producir(fila As Channel<Integer>)\n  For valor <- 4 To 6 Do\n    Define aceptado As Boolean <- Await fila.send(valor);\n    If Not aceptado Then\n      Write \"canal cerrado\";\n    EndIf\n  EndFor\n  fila.close();\nEndSubroutine\n\nSubroutine Suspendable Sumar(fila As Channel<Integer>)\n  Define total As Integer <- 0;\n  Repeat\n    Switch Await fila.receive() Do\n      Some(valor): total <- total + valor;\n      None: Break;\n    EndSwitch\n  Until False\n  Write total;\nEndSubroutine\n\nAlgorithm CanalSuma\n  Define fila As Channel<Integer> <- channel(2);\n  Tasks\n    Spawn Producir(fila);\n    Spawn Sumar(fila);\n  EndTasks\nEndAlgorithm\n","lines":[[["Subroutine","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["Suspendable","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Producir","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["fila","identifier"],[" "],["As","punctuation"],[" "],["Channel","type"],["<","operator"],["Integer","type"],[">","operator"],[")","punctuation"]],[["  "],["For","keywordStructured"],[" "],["valor","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["4","literalNumber"],[" "],["To","keywordStructured"],[" "],["6","literalNumber"],[" "],["Do","keywordStructured"]],[["    "],["Define","keywordStructured"],[" "],["aceptado","identifi